<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
      .header { background-color: #dc2626; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
      .content { background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 30px; }
      .notice { background-color: #fef2f2; border: 2px solid #dc2626; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 8px; }
      .button { display: inline-block; padding: 16px 32px; background-color: #4f46e5; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; }
      .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #666; font-size: 12px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Your TEEEM Trial Has Ended</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <h2>Hi <%= @user.first_name || @user.name %>,</h2>

        <div class="notice">
          <h3>Your trial for <%= @tenant.name %> has expired</h3>
          <p>Your account is now in read-only mode. Upgrade to restore full access.</p>
        </div>

        <h3>What this means:</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>You can still log in and view all your existing data</li>
          <li>You cannot create new jobs, contacts, or documents</li>
          <li>You cannot edit existing records</li>
          <li>Your data is safe and preserved for 30 days</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Ready to continue with TEEEM?</h3>
        <p>Upgrade to a paid plan and pick up right where you left off. All your data, settings, and team members will be exactly as you left them.</p>

        <div style="text-align: center;">
          <a href="<%= @upgrade_url %>" class="button">Upgrade to Continue</a>
        </div>

        <p>Need to talk about pricing or have questions? Reply to this email - we're here to help!</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; <%= Time.current.year %> Tekna. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
